  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Start with a magic ring. Work 6 dc into the ring. Increase every round using the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "top-down-crown-g230"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "top-down crown"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " method until the circle measures 16 cm across. Work straight in round for 18 cm to form the sides. The final rows can use "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dc2tog-g230"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "dc2tog"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " to add a slight gathered brim if preferred. Fasten off and close the start."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Circumference: approx. 56 cm. Depth from crown to brim: approx. 24 cm."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "suppliesCard",
        "attrs": {
          "heading": "Materials",
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "Super-chunky yarn",
              "qty": "80 yards"
            },
            {
              "name": "10 mm crochet hook",
              "qty": "1"
